{"voice":"IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD","model":"eleven_v3","chunks":[{"audio":"/audio-chapters/1.2-1.mp3","steps":[{"key":"intro","text":"Chapter 1.2: Vision, Mission and Values. Let's read it together, and I'll explain each part as we go.","words":[[0.223,0.328],[0.488,1.688],[1.757,2.168],[2.248,2.808],[2.888,3.128],[3.219,4.208],[4.318,4.728],[4.76,4.888],[4.941,5.048],[5.092,5.608],[5.648,5.768],[5.808,5.928],[5.978,6.328],[6.376,6.568],[6.616,6.808],[6.861,6.968],[7.021,7.128],[7.235,7.608]]},{"key":"identity#0","text":"What Eat Better stands for","words":[[8.856,8.888],[8.968,9.208],[9.242,9.448],[9.517,9.928],[10.028,10.328]]},{"key":"identity#1","text":"Scaling with Spring: A Journey of Aggressive Execution","words":[[11.138,11.768],[11.8,11.928],[11.997,12.808],[12.848,12.888],[12.938,13.288],[13.315,13.368],[13.448,13.928],[14.008,14.728]]},{"key":"identity#2","text":"“ The joy of snacking, made better ”","words":[[15.388,15.608],[15.628,15.688],[15.768,16.008],[16.035,16.088],[16.168,16.968],[17.032,17.288],[17.322,17.528],[17.568,17.608]]},{"key":"identity#3","text":"Shaurya Kanoria, Mridula Kanoria, Vidushi Kajaria","words":[[17.988,18.728],[18.788,19.368],[19.608,20.328],[20.388,20.968],[21.148,22.008],[22.048,22.648]]},{"key":"identity#explain","text":"Here's the idea: In this chapter we learn what Eat Better stands for. Its philosophy is better ingredients, better quality, and better for you.","words":[[23.976,24.088],[24.108,24.168],[24.28,25.128],[25.261,25.528],[25.576,25.768],[25.828,26.248],[26.355,26.568],[26.621,26.888],[26.92,27.048],[27.128,27.368],[27.402,27.608],[27.688,28.168],[28.248,28.568],[28.748,29.288],[29.361,30.088],[30.168,30.328],[30.374,30.648],[30.701,31.368],[31.448,31.928],[31.998,32.808],[32.888,33.128],[33.174,33.448],[33.528,33.768],[33.828,34.408]]},{"key":"direction#0","text":"Where it's going — and how it gets there","words":[[35.326,35.37],[35.423,35.61],[35.677,36.01],[36.17,36.33],[36.35,36.41],[36.45,36.57],[36.623,36.73],[36.778,36.97],[37.023,37.29]]},{"key":"direction#1","text":"A vision is the destination. A mission is what the brand does every day to get there. Sort each card into the right box.","words":[[38.01,38.25],[38.319,38.73],[38.837,39.05],[39.09,39.21],[39.283,40.33],[40.45,40.57],[40.63,41.05],[41.183,41.45],[41.482,41.61],[41.63,41.69],[41.743,42.01],[42.09,42.41],[42.503,42.97],[43.03,43.21],[43.263,43.37],[43.43,43.61],[43.65,44.17],[44.362,45.13],[45.178,45.37],[45.466,45.85],[45.898,46.09],[46.11,46.17],[46.223,46.49],[46.61,47.05]]},{"key":"direction#explain","text":"In simple words: The vision is where the brand wants to go: to become India's most loved family snacking brand. The mission is what it does every day to get there: to revive the Indian snacking category with healthier, tastier options for every household.","words":[[48.202,48.255],[48.312,48.655],[48.722,49.295],[49.355,49.535],[49.604,50.015],[50.095,50.255],[50.295,50.495],[50.535,50.655],[50.708,50.975],[51.042,51.375],[51.402,51.455],[51.562,52.415],[52.468,52.575],[52.621,52.895],[52.962,53.375],[53.455,53.775],[53.842,54.175],[54.244,54.655],[54.735,55.215],[55.282,55.695],[55.955,56.735],[56.825,57.455],[57.508,57.615],[57.647,57.775],[57.828,57.935],[57.983,58.175],[58.242,58.575],[58.655,58.895],[58.922,58.975],[59.055,59.295],[59.335,60.175],[60.228,60.335],[60.404,60.815],[60.855,60.975],[61.044,61.455],[61.535,62.015],[62.086,62.655],[62.735,63.055],[63.111,63.855],[63.919,64.415],[64.475,64.895],[64.975,65.215],[65.282,65.615],[65.679,66.335]]},{"key":"values#0","text":"Three values behind every snack","words":[[67.735,67.935],[68.015,68.495],[68.552,68.895],[68.962,69.295],[69.388,69.855]]},{"key":"values#explain","text":"Think of it like this: Three values sit behind every snack the brand makes, and you can see them in its ingredients, its quality checks and its products.","words":[[71.033,71.055],[71.108,71.215],[71.242,71.295],[71.343,71.535],[71.615,72.575],[72.615,72.815],[72.895,73.375],[73.435,73.615],[73.672,74.015],[74.082,74.415],[74.482,74.815],[74.835,74.895],[74.962,75.295],[75.375,76.095],[76.135,76.255],[76.275,76.335],[76.375,76.495],[76.555,76.735],[76.783,76.975],[77.028,77.135],[77.175,77.295],[77.355,78.335],[78.375,78.495],[78.555,78.975],[79.032,79.375],[79.535,80.015],[80.055,80.175],[80.246,81.215]]},{"key":"practices#0","text":"Turning the vision into decisions","words":[[82.05,82.26],[82.3,82.42],[82.477,82.82],[82.9,83.22],[83.284,83.86]]},{"key":"practices#1","text":"Sweetening laddoos and sweet snacks naturally with dates and dry fruits instead of refined sugar .","words":[[84.7,85.54],[85.58,86.02],[86.06,86.18],[86.247,86.58],[86.649,87.06],[87.124,87.7],[87.78,88.1],[88.18,88.58],[88.64,88.82],[88.9,89.14],[89.209,89.62],[89.7,90.26],[90.313,90.42],[90.48,90.9],[90.967,91.3],[91.34,91.38]]},{"key":"practices#2","text":"Choosing roasting over deep-frying for traditional namkeens , with a strict ban on palm oil and harmful fats.","words":[[92.136,92.42],[92.5,93.06],[93.124,93.38],[93.444,94.18],[94.24,94.42],[94.467,94.98],[95.06,95.7],[95.9,96.1],[96.132,96.26],[96.3,96.34],[96.397,96.74],[96.84,97.14],[97.22,97.38],[97.46,97.78],[97.88,98.18],[98.24,98.42],[98.48,98.9],[99.012,99.54]]},{"key":"practices#3","text":"Inspecting every batch across six mandatory quality checkpoints before dispatch .","words":[[100.18,101.06],[101.127,101.46],[101.54,101.94],[101.997,102.34],[102.42,102.66],[102.74,103.46],[103.52,103.94],[104,104.66],[104.751,105.3],[105.38,106.02],[106.16,106.3]]},{"key":"practices#4","text":"Eliminating artificial preservatives , hydrogenated oils , and unnecessary fillers to ensure transparency .","words":[[106.724,107.62],[107.678,108.26],[108.308,108.98],[109.14,109.3],[109.362,110.1],[110.212,110.66],[110.78,110.9],[110.94,111.06],[111.133,111.94],[112.004,112.5],[112.607,112.82],[112.889,113.3],[113.374,114.26],[114.4,114.54]]},{"key":"practices#5","text":"Decide whether each choice gets through the filter — then watch it drop.","words":[[114.957,115.78],[115.81,116.02],[116.084,116.34],[116.409,116.82],[116.884,117.14],[117.17,117.38],[117.4,117.46],[117.529,117.94],[118.18,118.42],[118.484,118.74],[118.833,119.3],[119.327,119.38],[119.46,119.859]]},{"key":"practices#6","text":"Sweetening laddoos and sweet snacks naturally with dates and dry fruits instead of refined sugar .","words":[[119.86,121.46],[121.5,121.94],[121.98,122.1],[122.167,122.5],[122.569,122.98],[123.036,123.54],[123.588,123.78],[123.86,124.26],[124.3,124.42],[124.5,124.74],[124.809,125.22],[125.31,125.94],[125.967,126.02],[126.08,126.5],[126.567,126.9],[126.94,126.98]]},{"key":"practices#7","text":"Does this help make snacks that are both tasty and better for you?","words":[[127.988,128.02],[128.084,128.34],[128.388,128.58],[128.628,128.82],[128.889,129.3],[129.332,129.46],[129.5,129.62],[129.668,129.86],[129.94,130.34],[130.5,130.98],[131.014,131.22],[131.28,131.46],[131.52,132.1]]},{"key":"practices#explain","text":"So what does that mean? A vision only matters when it guides real decisions. Each idea is checked against it: does this help us make snacks that are both tasty and better for you?","words":[[133.033,133.06],[133.076,133.14],[133.188,133.38],[133.412,133.54],[133.62,134.38],[134.6,134.82],[134.889,135.3],[135.38,135.7],[135.76,136.18],[136.212,136.34],[136.367,136.42],[136.489,136.9],[136.98,137.3],[137.364,138.02],[138.196,138.9],[138.996,139.38],[139.46,139.62],[139.66,139.94],[139.99,140.34],[140.393,141.14],[141.172,141.3],[141.348,141.54],[141.588,141.78],[141.833,141.94],[141.988,142.18],[142.249,142.66],[142.692,142.82],[142.84,142.9],[142.948,143.14],[143.233,143.7],[143.82,144.18],[144.214,144.42],[144.48,144.66],[144.72,145.327]]},{"key":"offerings#0","text":"What it sells — and where","words":[[146.244,146.26],[146.313,146.42],[146.513,146.98],[147.1,147.22],[147.26,147.38],[147.447,147.78]]},{"key":"offerings#1","text":"Key product lines · official Eat Better Co photos.","words":[[148.53,148.98],[149.03,149.38],[149.473,149.94],[150.26,150.58],[150.633,151.06],[151.12,151.3],[151.346,151.62],[151.7,151.86],[151.951,152.86]]},{"key":"offerings#explain","text":"Let me explain: Finally, we look at what Eat Better sells, and the places where customers can buy it.","words":[[153.354,153.384],[153.437,153.544],[153.624,154.704],[154.769,155.544],[155.597,155.704],[155.736,155.864],[155.917,156.024],[156.056,156.184],[156.264,156.504],[156.55,156.824],[156.904,157.544],[157.584,157.704],[157.724,157.784],[157.853,158.264],[158.291,158.424],[158.48,158.984],[159.044,159.224],[159.284,159.464],[159.517,159.944]]},{"key":"think#0","text":"Your turn to lead","words":[[160.703,160.746],[160.794,160.986],[161.039,161.146],[161.226,161.546]]},{"key":"think#1","text":"Write your own vision statement for Eat Better in 20 words or fewer.","words":[[162.293,162.426],[162.474,162.666],[162.726,162.906],[162.963,163.306],[163.354,163.786],[163.826,163.946],[164.026,164.266],[164.312,164.586],[164.719,164.986],[165.146,165.306],[165.386,165.786],[165.866,166.026],[166.119,166.666]]},{"key":"think#explain","text":"Here's the idea: Remember this: a good vision is a filter. If a decision does not help the brand make snacks that are tasty and better for you, the answer is no.","words":[[167.765,167.866],[167.906,168.026],[168.122,169.026],[169.084,169.546],[169.61,169.946],[170.266,170.586],[170.634,170.826],[170.895,171.306],[171.386,171.546],[171.586,171.626],[171.695,172.186],[172.453,172.986],[173.026,173.066],[173.119,173.546],[173.594,173.786],[173.846,174.026],[174.074,174.266],[174.286,174.346],[174.413,174.746],[174.794,174.986],[175.055,175.466],[175.498,175.626],[175.666,175.786],[175.853,176.186],[176.306,176.666],[176.712,176.986],[177.046,177.226],[177.286,177.786],[177.826,177.946],[178.003,178.346],[178.453,178.666],[178.826,179.146]]},{"key":"outro","text":"And that's the whole chapter! You listened all the way through. Great job!